    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Steel Pipe Flanges for Waterworks Services (ANSI/AWWA C207-01)\n\n### Standards Overview\n\nThis tool provides specifications for ANSI/AWWA C207-01 slip-on flanges used in waterworks services, organized by pressure rating classes:\n\n- **Class B**: 86 psi pressure rating\n- **Class D**: 175-150 psi pressure rating  \n- **Class E**: 275 psi pressure rating\n- **Class F**: 300 psi pressure rating\n\n### Key Specifications\n\nEach flange is characterized by:\n- **Pipe Size**: Nominal pipe diameter in inches\n- **Outside Diameter**: External flange diameter\n- **Inside Diameter**: Slip-on bore diameter for pipe connection\n- **Number of Bolt Holes**: Count of bolt holes in the flange\n- **Bolt Hole Diameter**: Size of each bolt hole\n- **Bolt Circle**: Diameter of the circle on which bolt holes are located\n- **Thickness**: Flange thickness\n\n### Reference\nFor metric conversions: 1 inch = 25.4 mm\n\nSource: [AWWA - American Water Works Association](http://www.awwa.org/)"
    }
